# What desktop runs in rio: the windows of a session, each by window
# (-at's where is nw, n, ne, w, c, e, sw, s or se, so that this does
# not depend on the screen's size). As Plan 9's riostart.
window -desk desk
window -panel -edge bottom 28 panel
window -popup -hide -label startmenu startmenu
window -at ne 400 160 stats
window -at c 640 480 files /usr/pad
